{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0151GbebowL7xfKCo29aRA3N","type":"tool_result","content":"Yes. `-p` is the short alias for `--project <name>`, which runs a named project from the workspace feature. It can be repeated, supports wildcards, and can exclude projects with a `!` prefix.\n\nThe page lists six options with single-letter aliases:\n\n- `-r` → `--root <path>`: sets the root path\n- `-c` → `--config <path>`: sets the config file path\n- `-u` → `--update [type]`: updates snapshots\n- `-w` → `--watch`: enables watch mode\n- `-t` → `--testNamePattern <pattern>`: runs tests whose full names match a regexp\n- `-p` → `--project <name>`: selects the project to run"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3aa93967-1ed0-47e4-a2e3-36a9c9525738","uuid":"58fe318d-b650-4239-bdf4-92b061f6b7c0","timestamp":"2026-10-11T10:46:41.653Z","tool_use_result":{"bytes":155146,"code":200,"codeText":"OK","result":"Yes. `-p` is the short alias for `--project <name>`, which runs a named project from the workspace feature. It can be repeated, supports wildcards, and can exclude projects with a `!` prefix.\n\nThe page lists six options with single-letter aliases:\n\n- `-r` → `--root <path>`: sets the root path\n- `-c` → `--config <path>`: sets the config file path\n- `-u` → `--update [type]`: updates snapshots\n- `-w` → `--watch`: enables watch mode\n- `-t` → `--testNamePattern <pattern>`: runs tests whose full names match a regexp\n- `-p` → `--project <name>`: selects the project to run","durationMs":3652,"url":"https://vitest.dev/guide/cli"},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_0151GbebowL7xfKCo29aRA3N","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
